#: PowerDevilRunner.cpp:75
msgid "Lists all power profiles and allows them to be activated"
msgstr "Senaraikan semua profil kuasa dan benarkan mereka untuk diaktifkan"

#: PowerDevilRunner.cpp:77
msgid ""
"Lists system suspend (e.g. sleep, hibernate) options and allows them to be "
"activated"
msgstr ""
"Senaraikan pilihan gantungan sistem (cth. sleep, hibernate) dan benarkan "
"mereka untuk diaktifkan"

#: PowerDevilRunner.cpp:84
msgid "Suspends the system to RAM"
msgstr "Gantung sistem ke RAM"

#: PowerDevilRunner.cpp:91
msgid "Suspends the system to disk"
msgstr "Gantung sistem ke cakera"

#: PowerDevilRunner.cpp:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Lists screen brightness options or sets it to the brightness defined by :q:; "
"e.g. screen brightness 50 would dim the screen to 50% maximum brightness"
msgstr ""
"Senaraikan pilihan kecerahan paparan atau tetapkan ke kecerahan yang "
"ditakrifkan oleh :q:; contoh. kecerahan skrin 50 akan meredupkan skrin untuk "
"kecerahan maksimum 50%"

#: PowerDevilRunner.cpp:189
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Note this is a KRunner keyword; %1 is a parameter"
msgid "power profile %1"
msgstr "profil kuasa %1"

#: PowerDevilRunner.cpp:201
#, kde-format
msgid "Set Profile to '%1'"
msgstr "Tetap Profil ke '%1'"

#: PowerDevilRunner.cpp:208
#, kde-format
